<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Pump oil for lvl 2 oil man. Just adjust a bit the delay and how long to press the left button of your mouse. And you have to do the captcha every 8-10 min so take care of that. Works for GRANDRP</Description>
    <Comment>https://botmek.com - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>MoveTo 300 750
LeftDown 1
Delay 2250 ms
LeftUp 1
MoveTo 400 750
LeftDown 1
Delay 2222 ms
LeftUp 1
MoveTo 500 750
LeftDown 1
Delay 2350 ms
LeftUp 1
MoveTo 600 750
LeftDown 1
Delay 2400 ms
LeftUp 1
GoWhile 1 1000</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>GTA 5 RP</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>